WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:00.040 --> 00:02.240
This series was created for entertainment purposes.

3
00:02.240 --> 00:05.680
The characters, actions, locations, dialogue, languages, ceremonies,

4
00:05.680 --> 00:08.120
and artistic elements depicted in this series

5
00:08.120 --> 00:10.040
are fictional and based on imagination,

6
00:10.040 --> 00:13.920
incorporating the beauty of the region's diverse cultures,

7
00:13.920 --> 00:18.400
including those of Lanna, Myanmar, the Tai peoples, and China.

8
00:18.400 --> 00:20.560
It is not intended to disrespect any history,

9
00:20.560 --> 00:23.600
ethnic group, organization, profession, or group of individuals.

10
00:23.600 --> 00:26.040
Viewer discretion is advised.

11
00:26.040 --> 00:27.520
[Previously] Thank you so much, Mr. Bew,

12
00:27.520 --> 00:29.800
for teaching me the physical therapy exercises.

13
00:29.800 --> 00:30.520
Bew!

14
00:30.520 --> 00:31.640
Do you know him?

15
00:31.640 --> 00:35.160
And thank you for giving me a reason to live again.

16
00:35.160 --> 00:36.200
What is your name, then?

17
00:36.200 --> 00:38.000
I could sing for you instead.

18
00:38.000 --> 00:38.920
Just look at you.

19
00:38.920 --> 00:40.520
I doubt you could even find your way back to your residence.

20
00:40.520 --> 00:42.360
Once I ascend the throne,

21
00:42.360 --> 00:45.240
everything in this palace will belong to me.

22
00:45.240 --> 00:47.600
How can our marriage ever work

23
00:47.600 --> 00:49.120
when the man who is supposed to be her life partner

24
00:49.120 --> 00:51.840
can't make her happy?

25
00:51.840 --> 00:56.960
The actor auditioning for Phaya Devaraja was in an accident?

26
00:56.960 --> 00:58.080
Yeah.

27
00:58.080 --> 01:02.120
Isn't that the third accident since we started casting?

28
01:02.800 --> 01:03.960
Yes.

29
01:03.960 --> 01:06.800
Guys, I don't think these are coincidences anymore.

30
01:06.800 --> 01:10.120
- Maybe this king is bringing us bad luck. - You're right.

31
01:11.720 --> 01:14.040
Should we change the lead character, Boon?

32
01:14.040 --> 01:16.560
Or maybe consult a fortune teller.

33
01:16.560 --> 01:20.280
They could help us decide whose story to tell.

34
01:22.120 --> 01:27.000
But Phaya Devaraja is the most complex character.

35
01:27.000 --> 01:31.200
If we tell the story through someone else, we'll lose some of the storylines.

36
01:32.200 --> 01:34.120
And we'd stray from the main theme.

37
01:34.120 --> 01:37.760
Can we please stick with him for now?

38
01:37.760 --> 01:42.640
The accidents were probably just coincidences.

39
01:44.800 --> 01:46.360
I'm sure...

40
01:47.520 --> 01:52.640
we'll find the right actor soon.

41
01:54.400 --> 01:56.120
Let's keep him as the lead.

42
02:02.160 --> 02:03.600
Okay.

43
02:04.600 --> 02:06.920
We'll try contacting another actor.

44
02:07.880 --> 02:10.000
But this is the last actor we'll try.

45
02:10.560 --> 02:14.520
If anything else goes wrong, I'll have to change the storyline.

46
03:54.520 --> 04:01.960
[Forbidden City]

47
04:08.560 --> 04:12.160
- These are fresh. I'll take a bunch. - Would you like some more today?

48
04:12.160 --> 04:14.840
Would you like the ones you ordered before as well?

49
04:14.840 --> 04:16.880
The ones you ordered last time?

50
04:16.880 --> 04:21.200
These two have just come in. I only got them this morning.

51
04:27.360 --> 04:29.000
This smells lovely.

52
04:29.000 --> 04:30.280
Yes.

53
04:33.960 --> 04:37.240
- We'll take these two as well. - These two as well?

54
04:37.240 --> 04:39.600
- Yes. - Of course.

55
04:39.600 --> 04:42.360
I barely got to enjoy my fabulous new life.

56
04:42.360 --> 04:44.480
Now I'm back to slaving away.

57
04:45.520 --> 04:49.080
It's just cooking. How hard can it be?

58
04:50.040 --> 04:54.640
Lha, I'll take care of dinner.

59
04:56.000 --> 04:57.320
What would you like to eat?

60
05:00.960 --> 05:02.520
Are you all right?

61
05:08.440 --> 05:11.160
- Are you all right? - It hurts.

62
05:11.160 --> 05:12.280
Be still.

63
05:12.280 --> 05:14.160
Careful.

64
05:14.160 --> 05:15.880
Can you walk?

65
05:18.480 --> 05:19.960
Please sit down.

66
05:22.920 --> 05:26.520
Please sit down. Let me take a look.

67
05:27.680 --> 05:28.680
What are you doing?

68
05:28.680 --> 05:32.560
Earlier, you had a sharp pain that stopped you from getting up.

69
05:32.560 --> 05:37.520
But have you felt any pain or numbness radiating from your hips down your legs?

70
05:39.920 --> 05:44.000
When you change positions, whether standing, walking, or sitting,

71
05:45.000 --> 05:48.280
do you feel tightness around here as well?

72
05:51.080 --> 05:52.480
Just as I thought.

73
05:53.400 --> 05:55.320
Please lie down. Lha.

74
05:55.320 --> 05:56.320
- My lady? - Help me.

75
05:56.320 --> 05:59.520
- What on earth are you doing? - Please lie down.

76
06:02.040 --> 06:03.920
Please raise your legs slowly.

77
06:05.760 --> 06:07.360
Lady Fongnuan?

78
06:09.800 --> 06:12.480
I'll massage your muscles to help them relax.

79
06:12.480 --> 06:15.320
It might hurt a little, but you'll feel better afterward.

80
06:15.320 --> 06:17.840
The piriformis muscle is right here.

81
06:30.080 --> 06:31.720
This might hurt a little.

82
06:36.760 --> 06:39.320
This is called piriformis syndrome.

83
06:39.320 --> 06:41.720
It happens when the piriformis muscle compresses a nerve.

84
06:41.720 --> 06:42.760
It usually occurs

85
06:42.760 --> 06:45.160
when someone stays in the same position for too long,

86
06:45.160 --> 06:48.000
whether sitting, standing, or lying down for extended periods,

87
06:48.000 --> 06:50.000
like your mother.

88
06:50.000 --> 06:52.080
Are you feeling better?

89
06:56.240 --> 07:00.320
From now on, please avoid standing or sitting in one position for too long.

90
07:00.320 --> 07:03.800
It's best to keep moving to improve your circulation.

91
07:05.120 --> 07:08.160
If possible, try applying warm compresses

92
07:08.160 --> 07:12.720
and doing daily exercises to stretch these muscles.

93
07:14.200 --> 07:18.800
Otherwise, you may eventually lose the ability to walk.

94
07:23.800 --> 07:25.720
Try stretching your legs.

95
07:29.760 --> 07:31.600
Does that feel better?

96
07:40.160 --> 07:44.080
Well, are you a masseuse or a fortune teller?

97
07:45.320 --> 07:47.960
You talk as if you can see my future.

98
07:47.960 --> 07:53.320
How do you know I spend so much time sitting or standing in one position?

99
07:55.680 --> 08:00.320
I've known someone who had symptoms like yours.

100
08:04.760 --> 08:06.400
Thank you very much.

101
08:07.680 --> 08:09.800
Where are you from?

102
08:09.800 --> 08:11.320
What is your name?

103
08:11.920 --> 08:16.160
My name is Fongnuan. I'm from Wang Nam Lin.

104
08:17.160 --> 08:21.000
Lady Fongnuan is Princess Maneethip's cousin.

105
08:21.000 --> 08:24.240
She's currently staying at Wiang Kaew's House of Guests.

106
08:26.760 --> 08:29.200
And how do you know all this?

107
08:32.880 --> 08:34.840
I've been wondering that myself.

108
08:34.840 --> 08:37.080
How do you know, my lady?

109
08:37.080 --> 08:40.080
I've served you since you were little.

110
08:40.080 --> 08:42.400
You never knew any of this before.

111
08:43.160 --> 08:44.560
Well...

112
08:44.560 --> 08:46.080
It happened that day.

113
08:46.080 --> 08:49.160
When I woke up during the ceremony,

114
08:49.160 --> 08:53.480
it felt like a sign from above.

115
08:54.960 --> 08:56.640
What ceremony?

116
08:59.360 --> 09:02.000
The Water Spirit Ceremony.

117
09:02.760 --> 09:04.720
Lady Fongnuan lost consciousness.

118
09:04.720 --> 09:07.440
When she came to,

119
09:07.440 --> 09:11.400
she might have had a vision.

120
09:12.560 --> 09:15.120
That's right. Exactly what she said.

121
09:19.920 --> 09:21.880
Thank you very much.

122
09:21.880 --> 09:24.800
You're kind to a stranger.

123
09:24.800 --> 09:29.560
Though you seem rather eccentric, you came to my aid.

124
09:30.280 --> 09:32.240
Perhaps there's more to you than your madness.

125
09:34.920 --> 09:38.280
By the way, who did you come here with?

126
09:38.280 --> 09:40.840
Would you like Lha and me to escort you back to your residence?

127
09:41.400 --> 09:42.800
There's no need.

128
09:42.800 --> 09:45.400
My residence isn't far from here. I can make my own way back.

129
09:47.280 --> 09:48.560
Please be careful.

130
09:52.600 --> 09:54.280
Have a safe journey home.

131
10:38.120 --> 10:45.520
[Lady Homjan]

132
10:45.520 --> 10:47.240
Lady Homjan.

133
10:51.520 --> 10:53.960
Why have you summoned me?

134
10:56.520 --> 10:59.800
Today, I met a young lady at the market.

135
10:59.800 --> 11:03.400
She's quick on her feet, clever,

136
11:04.280 --> 11:07.720
and has a way with words.

137
11:07.720 --> 11:10.280
I took quite a liking to her.

138
11:12.400 --> 11:14.320
According to your books,

139
11:14.320 --> 11:17.920
is today an unlucky day for me?

140
11:27.560 --> 11:29.840
Today is an auspicious day.

141
11:31.040 --> 11:34.000
Whatever comes your way today...

142
11:35.240 --> 11:37.800
is sure to bring good fortune.

143
12:25.400 --> 12:29.280
- I pay my respects to you, Your Majesty. - I pay my respects to you, Your Majesty.

144
13:24.080 --> 13:27.120
The pedestal tray is ready, Your Majesty.

145
13:45.400 --> 13:48.240
Please have some tea leaf wraps.

146
13:48.240 --> 13:51.600
I've added salt, rock sugar, and sliced ginger, just the way you like it.

147
13:51.600 --> 13:55.560
But this time, I fermented the leaves for a shorter time

148
13:55.560 --> 13:58.120
to give them a more astringent taste.

149
13:58.120 --> 14:02.280
Young people prefer their tea leaves sour.

150
14:02.280 --> 14:06.880
But older folk like me prefer a more astringent taste.

151
14:07.520 --> 14:11.680
Are you suggesting that I'm old?

152
14:11.680 --> 14:15.080
I'm getting older by the day myself.

153
14:15.080 --> 14:19.120
Perhaps it's time I found someone else to help care for you, Your Majesty.

154
14:19.760 --> 14:22.200
You're still in good health.

155
14:22.200 --> 14:24.320
You won't die before me.

156
14:24.320 --> 14:27.520
Life is uncertain, Your Majesty.

157
14:27.520 --> 14:31.520
If you should die, I shall follow you.

158
14:32.720 --> 14:34.840
Please don't say that, Your Majesty.

159
14:35.640 --> 14:41.560
I'm fortunate to have been blessed with Your Majesty's kindness.

160
14:42.400 --> 14:44.960
It is my duty...

161
14:44.960 --> 14:47.520
to care for Your Majesty to the best of my ability.

162
14:49.040 --> 14:50.920
As for me,

163
14:52.000 --> 14:55.800
if I can serve Your Majesty until my dying breath,

164
14:56.600 --> 14:58.720
I shall die in peace.

165
15:04.200 --> 15:06.880
If Your Majesty would be so gracious,

166
15:06.880 --> 15:09.840
I have a request to make.

167
15:11.040 --> 15:12.320
Speak.

168
15:13.200 --> 15:15.840
I met a young lady at the market today.

169
15:16.680 --> 15:19.440
There was something special about her.

170
15:19.440 --> 15:23.040
I believe she could be of great help to Wiang Kaew.

171
15:24.240 --> 15:29.720
You've never once asked me to bring anyone into Wiang Kaew.

172
15:31.120 --> 15:34.760
This young lady must be quite extraordinary.

173
15:42.040 --> 15:44.920
- Cheers! - Shia!

174
15:51.160 --> 15:53.520
Is it wrong to be born a prince?

175
15:54.280 --> 15:58.360
Why must social status stand in the way of love?

176
15:58.360 --> 16:02.400
Why must there be conditions? Isn't love enough?

177
16:02.400 --> 16:05.040
That's life.

178
16:05.040 --> 16:09.280
Princes like you have it especially hard.

179
16:09.280 --> 16:12.520
You were born into a life of comfort,

180
16:12.520 --> 16:16.360
yet you can't find happiness when it comes to love.

181
16:16.360 --> 16:18.920
But don't despair.

182
16:18.920 --> 16:24.240
You're not the only one who struggles with love.

183
16:24.240 --> 16:29.400
Even a normal lady like me has the same troubles.

184
16:33.120 --> 16:36.520
Being loved...

185
16:46.680 --> 16:48.680
doesn't necessarily mean...

186
16:49.840 --> 16:53.320
you'll be happy.

187
16:53.320 --> 16:57.640
So that means,

188
16:58.400 --> 17:00.760
regardless of our station in life,

189
17:02.120 --> 17:04.480
we all suffer because of love.

190
17:06.000 --> 17:09.840
You speak the truth, Senior.

191
17:12.720 --> 17:14.920
Even so,

192
17:14.920 --> 17:17.080
I still want to experience love.

193
17:20.360 --> 17:21.840
A woman.

194
17:21.840 --> 17:23.320
Beautiful.

195
17:25.720 --> 17:29.200
Unless you want to get hurt, keep that shrill voice down.

196
17:29.200 --> 17:30.800
You startled the horse.

197
17:31.480 --> 17:35.160
What is your name, then?

198
17:35.160 --> 17:38.000
I could sing for you instead.

199
17:38.000 --> 17:39.080
Just look at you.

200
17:39.080 --> 17:41.240
I doubt you could even find your way back to your residence.

201
17:42.800 --> 17:44.080
Wait!

202
17:51.960 --> 17:54.000
Are you in love, Kong Tai?

203
17:54.920 --> 17:57.160
Are you in love, Kong Tai?

204
17:59.880 --> 18:02.520
He's definitely smitten.

205
18:02.520 --> 18:04.080
- Smitten? - Smitten?

206
18:06.040 --> 18:09.240
He's fallen in love.

207
18:14.920 --> 18:19.120
Well, anyone can fall in love at first sight.

208
18:19.920 --> 18:23.280
It's fate. It's destiny.

209
18:26.200 --> 18:31.320
If fate has decreed that I must suffer,

210
18:31.320 --> 18:33.040
I'd rather have none of it.

211
18:33.720 --> 18:37.160
If I'm to be forced to live with someone I don't love,

212
18:38.800 --> 18:41.280
I'd rather never love at all.

213
18:41.280 --> 18:43.280
I'd rather die!

214
18:43.280 --> 18:47.280
If your heart can't take it, don't go looking for love.

215
18:47.280 --> 18:48.960
You'll only get hurt.

216
18:48.960 --> 18:50.000
Cheers!

217
18:50.000 --> 18:52.120
- Hey! - Shia!

218
18:52.120 --> 18:56.760
Did you all invite me out for drinks just to make me listen to your sad stories?

219
18:56.760 --> 18:58.360
Who's sad, Your Highness?

220
18:59.840 --> 19:04.680
- I'm not sad. - I'm... not sad either.

221
19:04.680 --> 19:06.080
I'm sad.

222
19:15.680 --> 19:17.760
I'd better get going.

223
19:17.760 --> 19:20.760
I don't want to be around sad people.

224
19:20.760 --> 19:24.160
If you want to be sad, suit yourselves.

225
19:24.880 --> 19:27.200
Off you go, Fongnuan.

226
19:27.200 --> 19:31.040
Goodbye, Fongnuan. Love is a wonderful thing.

227
19:31.040 --> 19:34.080
- Don't be sad. - I'm not sad, Your Highness.

228
19:35.160 --> 19:36.600
Goodbye.

229
19:38.600 --> 19:40.600
Who's sad? Nobody's sad!

230
19:40.600 --> 19:42.320
- You're sad! - Hello?

231
19:42.320 --> 19:44.960
Bangkok, is that you?

232
19:44.960 --> 19:47.080
It's Fongnuan.

233
19:47.080 --> 19:49.240
Why can't I hear you?

234
19:49.240 --> 19:50.880
- Shia! - Shia!

235
19:56.440 --> 19:58.240
Wait, this is a shoe!

236
20:02.840 --> 20:04.720
I'm not sad.

237
20:05.760 --> 20:07.360
I'm not sad either.

238
20:08.000 --> 20:09.840
Fongnuan!

239
20:09.840 --> 20:11.320
Wrong way!

240
20:13.320 --> 20:17.400
This way! Back to my residence!

241
20:17.400 --> 20:19.560
Let's go!

242
20:20.760 --> 20:22.600
Junior! Fongnuan!

243
20:22.600 --> 20:25.720
- Junior! I said, wrong way! - Fongnuan!

244
20:28.720 --> 20:30.920
Junior! Fongnuan!

245
20:33.320 --> 20:35.160
- Fongnuan! - Junior!

246
20:38.360 --> 20:40.240
Junior, where are you?

247
20:40.240 --> 20:42.440
- Junior! - Fongnuan!

248
20:42.440 --> 20:44.000
Help!

249
20:44.880 --> 20:46.440
Fongnuan!

250
20:46.440 --> 20:48.000
Help!

251
20:49.080 --> 20:50.960
Stop choking me!

252
20:54.200 --> 20:56.080
You've all gotten into trouble again.

253
20:59.120 --> 21:00.800
How did you end up in the water?

254
21:03.160 --> 21:05.120
- We were drunk. - We were drunk.

255
21:10.960 --> 21:13.040
Who should I punish?

256
21:13.640 --> 21:15.120
Me.

257
21:15.120 --> 21:17.040
I failed to look after them properly.

258
21:20.560 --> 21:22.200
Next time we get drunk...

259
21:22.200 --> 21:23.880
We'll make sure not to fall into the water again.

260
21:23.880 --> 21:25.680
There won't be a next time.

261
21:25.680 --> 21:27.560
How can you even think of getting drunk again?

262
21:30.960 --> 21:33.320
You may return to your residences.

263
21:33.320 --> 21:34.720
Yes.

264
22:35.120 --> 22:36.600
Your Highness!

265
22:38.480 --> 22:42.880
If I don't dry you off, you'll fall ill.

266
22:42.880 --> 22:46.120
You could've asked Lha or one of the other maids to do it.

267
22:46.120 --> 22:48.720
Lha went to the temple with Maneethip.

268
22:48.720 --> 22:51.320
If I asked the other maids,

269
22:52.600 --> 22:55.280
they'd find out you got drunk and fell into the water.

270
22:56.440 --> 22:59.480
Then, I'll do it myself.

271
23:02.800 --> 23:04.600
How many times have I told you?

272
23:04.600 --> 23:08.360
It's improper for a lady to drink alcohol.

273
23:08.360 --> 23:10.880
Prince Fah Haam needed someone to comfort him.

274
23:10.880 --> 23:11.760
As his companion,

275
23:11.760 --> 23:15.240
I couldn't just sit there and listen without drinking.

276
23:15.240 --> 23:18.200
- Is it your duty to comfort everyone? - No, Your Highness.

277
23:18.200 --> 23:20.720
Only those who matter to me.

278
23:23.400 --> 23:26.040
You've become quite sharp-tongued.

279
23:27.080 --> 23:31.400
Are you scolding me for talking back?

280
23:35.160 --> 23:36.760
You should rest.

281
23:40.320 --> 23:42.840
You may stay here tonight.

282
23:42.840 --> 23:44.960
I won't be staying in this room.

283
23:44.960 --> 23:47.360
Your cousin sleeps here alone.

284
23:48.000 --> 23:49.680
Why is that?

285
23:52.000 --> 23:55.480
Maneethip has been going to the temple to pray every evening.

286
23:55.480 --> 24:01.680
She should be back soon. I'll tell her what happened.

287
24:06.560 --> 24:08.000
Your Highness.

288
24:12.080 --> 24:14.120
Ever since I woke up,

289
24:15.240 --> 24:17.800
I haven't fully regained my memory.

290
24:17.800 --> 24:22.360
I don't know why my cousin is behaving this way.

291
24:24.080 --> 24:27.320
But I know she's a good person.

292
24:29.520 --> 24:32.720
Please don't be angry with her.

293
24:33.760 --> 24:35.440
I know that all too well.

294
24:37.280 --> 24:42.640
I understand Maneethip, and accept her for who she is.

295
24:43.840 --> 24:46.200
But your cousin...

296
24:46.200 --> 24:48.400
has yet to accept me.

297
24:49.000 --> 24:52.600
You said yourself that she needs time.

298
24:54.360 --> 24:56.840
So I must give her time.

299
25:14.400 --> 25:18.320
You want me to send people to gather information in Wang Nam Lin?

300
25:18.320 --> 25:20.200
What would you like to know, Your Highness?

301
25:20.200 --> 25:23.000
I wish to know everything about Maneethip,

302
25:24.560 --> 25:26.600
especially her past.

303
25:27.960 --> 25:30.600
Have your people find out for certain...

304
25:31.560 --> 25:34.240
whether she ever had a lover in Wang Nam Lin.

305
25:40.240 --> 25:42.640
Isn't it too late, Your Highness?

306
25:42.640 --> 25:47.120
What good would knowing that do?

307
25:48.120 --> 25:50.720
For this marriage to work,

308
25:52.360 --> 25:54.680
we must get to know each other better.

309
25:55.800 --> 25:58.600
Perhaps I know too little about Maneethip.

310
25:59.320 --> 26:01.760
Or perhaps I never knew her at all.

311
26:04.000 --> 26:06.040
It may be too late.

312
26:07.400 --> 26:09.200
But I'd rather know the truth.

313
26:11.120 --> 26:13.080
See to it that this is done discreetly,

314
26:13.960 --> 26:15.520
and as soon as possible.

315
26:16.920 --> 26:18.120
I shall.

316
26:32.320 --> 26:34.320
It's getting late.

317
26:34.320 --> 26:36.240
Why hasn't she returned yet?

318
26:42.680 --> 26:44.000
Excuse me.

319
26:46.560 --> 26:50.040
Do you know which temple Cousin Maneethip visits for her evening prayers?

320
26:50.040 --> 26:53.680
Princess Maneethip is at Wat Khao Nam Saeng in the forest, my lady.

321
26:53.680 --> 26:57.560
I see. Which way is the temple?

322
27:04.160 --> 27:05.320
Cousin.

323
27:07.640 --> 27:09.080
Where are you?

324
27:25.760 --> 27:27.800
Wat Khao Nam Saeng.

325
27:28.760 --> 27:30.520
Is this really the place?

326
27:37.680 --> 27:39.480
Why have you come to see me?

327
27:45.200 --> 27:49.040
I didn't come to see you. I should be asking why you followed me.

328
27:50.040 --> 27:52.560
Do you think you're that important?

329
27:55.680 --> 27:57.840
Why do you keep pointing a knife at me?

330
27:57.840 --> 28:00.720
I don't like strangers wandering around my property.

331
28:02.760 --> 28:04.840
I'll ask you one last time.

332
28:04.840 --> 28:07.120
Why have you come here?

333
28:07.120 --> 28:09.320
I came to see Cousin Maneethip.

334
28:09.320 --> 28:11.760
She's here for her evening prayers.

335
28:15.120 --> 28:16.760
You've come to the wrong temple.

336
28:17.800 --> 28:22.480
But the maid told me to go straight, turn left, then right,

337
28:22.480 --> 28:24.760
until I reached a tamarind tree. And from there...

338
28:24.760 --> 28:27.560
Your Highness! Which way is Wat Khao Nam Saeng?

339
28:27.560 --> 28:30.320
Wait for me! Your Highness.

340
28:31.760 --> 28:34.840
Prince Mueang Fah. Wait for me.

341
28:39.760 --> 28:41.520
You're the only person around here.

342
28:41.520 --> 28:44.520
If you won't tell me, who else am I supposed to ask?

343
28:44.520 --> 28:45.880
If you wish to know,

344
28:45.880 --> 28:47.800
come and help me pick some lotuses,

345
28:47.800 --> 28:50.000
and I'll tell you.

346
28:50.000 --> 28:51.560
Pick lotuses?

347
28:53.880 --> 28:56.080
No. I won't.

348
28:56.080 --> 28:58.160
Go ahead and do it yourself.

349
29:29.000 --> 29:31.440
What are you picking lotuses for?

350
29:31.440 --> 29:33.240
To offer them to the monks.

351
29:36.320 --> 29:40.360
So, where is Wat Khao Nam Saeng?

352
29:42.800 --> 29:45.280
Even if I tell you now, you can't go there yet.

353
29:45.280 --> 29:47.080
Help me pick the lotuses first.

354
29:48.880 --> 29:50.640
Fine.

355
29:57.320 --> 30:00.840
The lotuses we offer to the monks must still be in bud.

356
30:00.840 --> 30:04.840
Their leaves must be intact, and their stems mustn't be too short.

357
30:14.920 --> 30:16.840
You'll bruise it if you hold it like that.

358
30:38.920 --> 30:40.320
Am I doing it right?

359
30:42.680 --> 30:45.560
It's not hard once you put your mind to it.

360
31:30.120 --> 31:32.480
What are you doing at this temple?

361
31:33.320 --> 31:36.400
If you want to know where Wat Khao Nam Saeng is,

362
31:36.400 --> 31:38.120
then keep quiet.

363
31:38.680 --> 31:42.760
If you wanted some peace and quiet, why did you make me get into this boat?

364
31:42.760 --> 31:45.080
You always have to talk back.

365
31:45.080 --> 31:48.280
I'm not talking back. I'm just being reasonable.

366
31:48.280 --> 31:53.200
I didn't even want to get into this boat in the first place.

367
31:53.200 --> 31:56.280
All I want is to know where Wat Khao Nam Saeng is.

368
31:56.280 --> 31:58.640
I need to find my cousin.

369
31:58.640 --> 32:00.880
I'm worried about her.

370
32:00.880 --> 32:03.680
Why did you make me pick lotuses?

371
32:13.600 --> 32:15.000
Now you're quiet again.

372
32:28.160 --> 32:32.320
The temple you're looking for is across that wooden bridge.

373
32:33.160 --> 32:35.480
Turn left at the large banyan tree.

374
32:36.320 --> 32:39.160
Then walk another 200 steps, and you'll be there.

375
32:39.960 --> 32:41.400
Thank you.

376
32:51.120 --> 32:54.560
I'll come help you pick lotuses again sometime.

377
32:54.560 --> 32:55.800
No need.

378
33:09.640 --> 33:12.320
You needn't have gone to the trouble of looking for me.

379
33:13.320 --> 33:15.440
I'm quite content here at the temple.

380
33:20.960 --> 33:25.880
You and Prince Saen Thep... are married.

381
33:25.880 --> 33:29.640
Why not give him a chance...

382
33:29.640 --> 33:32.360
to be by your side?

383
33:36.040 --> 33:41.280
I want you to have someone you can lean on.

384
33:42.680 --> 33:45.200
I want you to be happy.

385
33:47.840 --> 33:49.320
Fongnuan,

386
33:50.800 --> 33:53.000
my happiness...

387
33:53.000 --> 33:54.640
is you.

388
33:56.600 --> 33:59.160
Just seeing you healthy again...

389
33:59.840 --> 34:02.400
and able to lecture me like this...

390
34:03.080 --> 34:05.240
is enough to make me happy.

391
34:09.360 --> 34:11.920
Since you've come all this way to find me,

392
34:13.480 --> 34:18.520
why don't the three of us... stay here together tonight?

393
34:19.400 --> 34:21.120
Tomorrow,

394
34:22.120 --> 34:24.520
I'll ask Prince Saen Thep's permission...

395
34:25.320 --> 34:28.360
for you two to move into our residence.

396
34:35.240 --> 34:37.520
I don't think that's a good idea.

397
34:37.520 --> 34:42.360
What if Prince Saen Thep... wants to spend time with you?

398
34:43.320 --> 34:45.400
That's right.

399
34:45.400 --> 34:50.400
It would be better for Lady Fongnuan and me to stay where we are.

400
34:58.520 --> 35:03.200
We'll come visit you more often.

401
35:03.840 --> 35:05.400
How does that sound?

402
35:08.880 --> 35:11.280
Even without you two,

403
35:11.960 --> 35:15.760
my maids keep me company every night.

404
35:45.680 --> 35:47.680
Don't you love me at all?

405
35:48.640 --> 35:52.240
All this time, I never knew. But now I do.

406
35:52.240 --> 35:56.080
I cannot accept it. Please, leave me be.

407
36:07.920 --> 36:10.920
So this is where you two brothers have been hiding.

408
36:18.160 --> 36:20.040
Such sorrowful music.

409
36:23.880 --> 36:26.320
And an empty liquor jar.

410
36:26.320 --> 36:27.960
Prince Kong Tai.

411
36:37.760 --> 36:43.200
Prince Kong Tai told me you've been heartsick.

412
36:43.960 --> 36:46.080
It seems he was right.

413
36:50.760 --> 36:55.120
What Kong Tai knows, all of Wiang Kaew knows.

414
36:57.200 --> 37:02.120
Even if he hadn't told me, I would have known.

415
37:02.960 --> 37:06.320
A son can never hide anything from his mother.

416
37:07.360 --> 37:13.040
Though I'm not your birth mother, I've raised you since you were little.

417
37:19.640 --> 37:21.800
If I weren't a prince,

418
37:25.280 --> 37:27.960
if I'd been born your son,

419
37:31.200 --> 37:33.480
perhaps life would be much easier.

420
37:37.160 --> 37:38.960
Not necessarily.

421
37:39.720 --> 37:43.400
It might be a hundred or even a thousand times harder.

422
37:46.120 --> 37:51.520
As the head of the ladies-in-waiting, I face difficulties every single day.

423
37:53.280 --> 37:56.040
How could my son have an easy life?

424
38:07.000 --> 38:11.640
If only I were even half as strong as you,

425
38:13.000 --> 38:14.560
I'd be content.

426
38:17.640 --> 38:21.560
No amount of drinking will ease the pain you're going through.

427
38:22.640 --> 38:26.960
The pain is in your heart. That's where it must heal.

428
38:28.200 --> 38:33.320
But this wound runs deep.

429
38:35.720 --> 38:40.240
Wounds take time to heal.

430
38:40.240 --> 38:46.040
Once yours has fully healed, the pain will fade.

431
38:48.360 --> 38:50.560
Give it time.

432
38:50.560 --> 38:53.360
Time will heal your wound.

433
38:53.960 --> 38:59.600
And once you've healed, don't let yourself get hurt again.

434
39:44.000 --> 39:46.600
The King has issued a royal decree...

435
39:48.200 --> 39:50.640
appointing Lady Fongnuan...

436
39:52.400 --> 39:56.160
as a lady-in-waiting in the outer court of Wiang Kaew,

437
39:58.720 --> 40:02.040
under the supervision of Lady Homjan,

438
40:02.760 --> 40:05.240
effective immediately.

439
40:22.680 --> 40:26.720
The King has spoken. You must accept the royal decree.

440
40:26.720 --> 40:29.040
- But I don't want to go to Wiang Kaew. - You must.

441
40:30.200 --> 40:32.520
Accept the royal decree at once, Fongnuan.

442
40:46.720 --> 40:50.000
I humbly accept the royal decree.

443
41:19.960 --> 41:22.800
Why has Father summoned her to Wiang Kaew?

444
41:24.360 --> 41:26.360
How would I know?

445
41:26.360 --> 41:28.040
But I think it's for the best.

446
41:29.320 --> 41:31.760
At least she won't be moving in here.

447
41:31.760 --> 41:34.400
She'd only be eating our food and using up our resources.

448
41:35.160 --> 41:39.200
- Can't you order her back to Wang Nam Lin? - No!

449
41:39.200 --> 41:43.160
- I cannot defy an order from Wiang Kaew. - I don't want her anywhere near Father.

450
41:43.160 --> 41:45.920
Nor do I want her getting close to any of my siblings.

451
41:55.200 --> 41:56.760
But I think...

452
41:58.080 --> 41:59.880
we should let her go.

453
42:00.960 --> 42:05.120
So she can keep an eye on what goes on inside Wiang Kaew...

454
42:05.120 --> 42:07.000
and report back to us.

455
42:12.120 --> 42:13.960
But I don't understand.

456
42:14.920 --> 42:16.480
Why her?

457
42:23.240 --> 42:27.000
Perhaps she was meant to serve in the inner court.

458
42:28.080 --> 42:33.000
Fongnuan was appointed to the outer court, not the inner court.

459
42:33.000 --> 42:36.680
- The outer court? - I had someone look into it.

460
42:36.680 --> 42:40.840
Homjan was the one who asked Father to summon Fongnuan.

461
42:40.840 --> 42:42.760
Homjan?

462
42:42.760 --> 42:45.360
Fah Haam and Kong Tai's nursemaid?

463
42:46.560 --> 42:49.040
Why would she want Fongnuan there?

464
42:50.200 --> 42:52.280
That's what puzzles me.

465
42:55.920 --> 42:58.320
Normally, ladies-in-waiting at Wiang Kaew

466
42:58.320 --> 43:02.280
are selected or appointed by the Queen.

467
43:02.280 --> 43:07.080
But this time, Homjan went directly to Father to request a royal decree.

468
43:08.920 --> 43:10.840
Don't you see?

469
43:10.840 --> 43:14.400
This interference goes against court customs.

470
43:14.400 --> 43:18.120
I'm worried that if Fongnuan,

471
43:18.120 --> 43:23.760
the cousin of Saen Thep's wife, wins Father's favor,

472
43:23.760 --> 43:28.080
your position as Crown Prince could be threatened.

473
43:28.080 --> 43:33.800
If she manages to get close to Father and learn Wiang Kaew's secrets,

474
43:35.560 --> 43:39.480
she could gain considerable influence.

475
43:42.320 --> 43:46.400
Fongnuan could help Saen Thep gain Father's favor,

476
43:47.360 --> 43:52.360
or perhaps Homjan will intervene

477
43:52.360 --> 43:57.640
to help Fah Haam and Kong Tai, whom Father has never favored,

478
43:57.640 --> 43:59.720
win his favor instead.

479
44:11.200 --> 44:14.520
Rumors of your misdeeds

480
44:14.520 --> 44:18.560
with Prince Pha Wiang are spreading.

481
44:21.720 --> 44:24.080
Whether they're true or not,

482
44:25.240 --> 44:27.760
your reputation will suffer either way.

483
44:31.720 --> 44:37.800
I think you should... keep a close eye on Fongnuan.

484
44:38.720 --> 44:40.760
She cannot be trusted.

485
44:50.960 --> 44:52.920
I'm not going to Wiang Kaew.

486
44:52.920 --> 44:55.640
I thought you wanted me to move in here with you.

487
44:56.960 --> 44:58.960
Fongnuan,

488
44:58.960 --> 45:03.360
being summoned to Wiang Kaew is a great honor.

489
45:03.360 --> 45:09.200
The opportunity to serve the King is a rare privilege.

490
45:09.200 --> 45:10.840
But I don't want to go.

491
45:10.840 --> 45:12.760
Why not?

492
45:12.760 --> 45:14.320
Are you afraid?

493
45:17.720 --> 45:22.400
Moving to Wiang Kaew isn't what I want.

494
45:23.560 --> 45:26.520
I know you value your freedom.

495
45:27.360 --> 45:29.840
You prefer to stick to what you know.

496
45:29.840 --> 45:31.560
But think about it.

497
45:32.240 --> 45:34.920
By moving there,

498
45:34.920 --> 45:37.160
you'll have a chance to learn new things...

499
45:37.920 --> 45:41.000
and show what you're capable of.

500
45:42.200 --> 45:43.720
Fongnuan,

501
45:44.800 --> 45:50.560
venturing beyond what you know doesn't mean losing who you are.

502
45:51.440 --> 45:53.480
It means you're growing.

503
45:54.600 --> 45:55.440
But...

504
45:55.440 --> 45:58.000
But if you refuse to go to Wiang Kaew,

505
45:58.000 --> 46:00.000
your cousin and I,

506
46:00.000 --> 46:02.560
perhaps even everyone at Chiang La-or's Residence,

507
46:02.560 --> 46:04.320
will suffer the consequences.

508
46:04.920 --> 46:09.160
If Father becomes angry, we could all be punished.

509
46:09.160 --> 46:11.240
Punished?

510
46:20.960 --> 46:22.600
I promise...

511
46:24.000 --> 46:26.920
I'll look after you, even while we're apart.

512
46:26.920 --> 46:31.640
Your cousin and I... will visit you often.

513
46:31.640 --> 46:33.400
You won't be lonely.

514
46:34.160 --> 46:36.560
I don't want to cause trouble for anyone,

515
46:37.640 --> 46:40.000
especially you and my cousin.

516
46:43.320 --> 46:45.760
I'll go to Wiang Kaew.

517
47:14.200 --> 47:17.040
Fongnuan has been summoned to Wiang Kaew?

518
47:17.040 --> 47:19.480
Where did you hear that, Mother?

519
47:19.480 --> 47:24.080
I have eyes and ears everywhere in Wiang Kaew. I know everyone's every move.

520
47:24.720 --> 47:27.480
You're close to Kong Tai.

521
47:27.480 --> 47:30.040
And Kong Tai is close to Saen Thep.

522
47:32.120 --> 47:34.200
Look into this matter.

523
47:34.200 --> 47:37.200
Find out whether Chiang La-or is behind it.

524
47:39.480 --> 47:42.760
If you have eyes and ears everywhere in Wiang Kaew,

525
47:43.440 --> 47:45.720
why do you need me to investigate?

526
47:45.720 --> 47:49.280
They can't uncover every detail.

527
47:51.440 --> 47:54.120
This concerns us both.

528
47:54.920 --> 47:58.880
If Chiang La-or is plotting to use Fongnuan to win your father's favor,

529
47:59.720 --> 48:03.600
I want to be prepared before it's too late.

530
48:09.320 --> 48:11.600
Do as I say.

531
48:11.600 --> 48:13.920
Talk to Kong Tai.

532
48:13.920 --> 48:16.640
He's close to Saen Thep.

533
48:16.640 --> 48:20.080
- And Saen Thep-- - I prefer to keep things simple.

534
48:22.120 --> 48:24.360
I have an easier way.

535
48:32.640 --> 48:36.880
I don't know who's behind this, either.

536
48:38.000 --> 48:41.600
Before I knew it, I was being sent to Wiang Kaew.

537
48:41.600 --> 48:43.560
I'm still confused.

538
48:44.440 --> 48:47.160
Did Royal Consort Chiang La-or order you to go?

539
48:47.160 --> 48:48.400
No.

540
48:48.400 --> 48:53.040
That day, she looked just as surprised as I was.

541
48:54.680 --> 48:58.840
I really don't want to go. Who knows what awaits me there?

542
49:01.360 --> 49:04.440
Junior, don't worry.

543
49:04.440 --> 49:08.000
I'll look after you in Wiang Kaew.

544
49:08.000 --> 49:10.760
- Really? - Of course.

545
49:12.040 --> 49:14.360
I owe you my life.

546
49:15.400 --> 49:18.120
You saved me.

547
49:18.120 --> 49:19.520
Remember?

548
49:21.720 --> 49:23.480
You're my junior.

549
49:25.360 --> 49:28.800
As your senior, it's only right that I protect you.

550
49:30.960 --> 49:32.240
Deal.

551
49:57.920 --> 49:59.520
So...

552
49:59.520 --> 50:05.000
you really don't know who's behind this?

553
50:06.080 --> 50:07.440
No.

554
50:17.480 --> 50:19.440
It was me, Homjan.

555
50:19.440 --> 50:22.000
I had you summoned to Wiang Kaew.

556
50:22.000 --> 50:23.640
Auntie?

557
50:25.200 --> 50:27.320
You mustn't address her that way.

558
50:27.320 --> 50:29.640
You must call her Lady Homjan.

559
50:30.720 --> 50:32.640
Lady Homjan,

560
50:33.360 --> 50:35.720
I don't know anything about court duties.

561
50:35.720 --> 50:37.400
I'll teach you.

562
50:38.000 --> 50:41.400
Come here tomorrow and I'll teach you your duties.

563
50:41.400 --> 50:43.280
Tomorrow?

564
50:43.280 --> 50:44.480
Yes.

565
50:52.080 --> 50:57.760
You'll be a lady-in-waiting at Wiang Kaew, not a prisoner.

566
50:57.760 --> 51:01.480
If you wish to visit your family, you may ask the King's permission.

567
51:03.280 --> 51:08.640
For now, I'd like you to keep this a secret.

568
51:09.640 --> 51:15.120
Outer court ladies-in-waiting work closely with the King.

569
51:15.120 --> 51:19.880
The more people know, the greater the danger to you.

570
51:35.720 --> 51:38.840
They raided the villagers' rice barns in Ullavee.

571
51:38.840 --> 51:42.040
Merng Mang's soldiers cornered and killed four of them.

572
51:42.040 --> 51:45.080
The rest escaped with the rice.

573
51:47.360 --> 51:51.760
I'm truly sorry we couldn't recover the stolen rice.

574
51:51.760 --> 51:52.800
It's all right.

575
51:52.800 --> 51:55.920
Thank you for eliminating those vile bandits.

576
51:55.920 --> 51:57.680
You and your men have done well.

577
52:02.960 --> 52:06.320
Would you like an Eight Directions Yantra like ours?

578
52:11.080 --> 52:15.960
This yantra protects us in battle.

579
52:15.960 --> 52:19.800
Every soldier of Merng Mang bears one.

580
52:19.800 --> 52:23.360
The Eight Directions Yantra symbolizes our oath...

581
52:23.360 --> 52:27.280
to lay down our lives for our nation and our King.

582
52:27.280 --> 52:29.400
I'm not from Merng Mang.

583
52:37.840 --> 52:41.640
Why is the Eight Directions Yantra circular?

584
52:41.640 --> 52:46.760
Merng Mang's Eight Directions Yantra is tattooed with oil.

585
52:46.760 --> 52:48.400
It leaves no visible mark.

586
52:49.080 --> 52:52.760
But the circle in the center is tattooed in ink...

587
52:52.760 --> 52:56.360
to remind us that we bear the yantra...

588
52:56.960 --> 52:59.000
and must abide by its rules.

589
53:00.480 --> 53:05.000
For if we break them, the yantra will no longer protect us.

590
53:13.360 --> 53:15.120
Is something wrong?

591
53:17.560 --> 53:22.760
I'll order the soldiers to bring the bandits' bodies back to Ullavee.

592
53:22.760 --> 53:24.600
What for?

593
53:24.600 --> 53:29.680
I want to investigate and find out...

594
53:31.000 --> 53:32.880
who was behind this.

595
53:36.600 --> 53:38.880
They died violent deaths.

596
53:38.880 --> 53:43.440
They should be cremated here so their spirits may rest in peace...

597
53:43.440 --> 53:47.240
rather than linger and bring misfortune upon the kingdom.

598
53:57.440 --> 54:00.240
If word of the raid on the rice barns gets out,

599
54:01.440 --> 54:04.160
it could affect our tribute collection.

600
54:07.560 --> 54:09.480
I agree with Pha Wiang.

601
54:11.400 --> 54:14.200
Proceed with the cremation.

602
54:33.560 --> 54:35.080
Take the bodies away for cremation.

603
54:53.440 --> 54:56.240
So you've all heard?

604
54:56.920 --> 54:58.680
So much for keeping it a secret.

605
55:00.040 --> 55:03.440
There's no such thing as a secret in Ullavee.

606
55:04.200 --> 55:06.560
Especially in Wiang Kaew.

607
55:12.200 --> 55:16.680
So, how do you feel about moving to Wiang Kaew?

608
55:18.520 --> 55:22.440
So much happens every day, even out here.

609
55:22.440 --> 55:27.720
Who knows what awaits me once I'm inside?

610
55:27.720 --> 55:33.000
You're our friend now. We'll always be there for you.

611
55:35.440 --> 55:37.080
Come on!

612
55:37.080 --> 55:38.360
Cheers!

613
55:38.360 --> 55:40.800
- Yeah! - Yeah!

614
55:44.080 --> 55:45.320
Cheers.

615
55:49.120 --> 55:51.360
Thank you so much.

616
55:52.200 --> 55:54.880
Ever since I traveled through...

617
55:58.440 --> 56:02.880
I mean, since I moved to Ullavee.

618
56:02.880 --> 56:07.640
You, you, and you are the only true friends I have.

619
56:08.240 --> 56:13.280
No matter what happens in the future,

620
56:13.880 --> 56:19.400
I hope we'll always be friends.

621
56:20.880 --> 56:22.080
Wait.

622
56:27.920 --> 56:31.960
You're talking strangely. As if you know the future.

623
56:34.200 --> 56:38.320
Junior, if you know the future, you must tell your senior.

624
56:38.320 --> 56:42.360
When will Mother stop controlling me?

625
56:43.560 --> 56:46.320
Will I meet the woman of my dreams?

626
56:47.440 --> 56:50.280
I can't wait to find out who she is.

627
56:58.760 --> 57:01.320
Phaya Devaraja,

628
57:01.320 --> 57:06.160
the last king, the most ruthless of all,

629
57:06.160 --> 57:11.200
who murdered his own siblings to seize the throne.

630
57:12.920 --> 57:14.400
Junior.

631
57:15.960 --> 57:17.400
Junior.

632
57:19.360 --> 57:21.280
- Fongnuan! - Yes?

633
57:23.720 --> 57:25.800
What's wrong?

634
57:25.800 --> 57:29.000
You're acting strangely again.

635
57:29.600 --> 57:32.880
I'm thinking about Wiang Kaew.

636
57:34.240 --> 57:38.600
As for your futures, I don't know.

637
57:39.160 --> 57:43.600
I don't even know what my own future holds.

638
57:46.320 --> 57:48.280
By the way,

639
57:48.280 --> 57:53.480
of all you princes,

640
57:53.480 --> 57:55.400
were any of you born elsewhere

641
57:55.400 --> 57:59.880
or brought here from another city?

642
58:00.440 --> 58:04.480
We were all born in Ullavee.

643
58:07.080 --> 58:11.760
What about Prince Pha Wiang?

644
58:12.680 --> 58:14.320
Prince Pha Wiang?

645
58:16.960 --> 58:17.880
I heard

646
58:17.880 --> 58:22.360
Prince Pha Wiang is Prince Indraraja's half-brother.

647
58:22.360 --> 58:26.680
I suppose he might have lived here.

648
58:26.680 --> 58:28.480
No.

649
58:29.320 --> 58:34.000
Though Prince Pha Wiang comes and goes as if this were his own home,

650
58:35.400 --> 58:38.920
he isn't considered a native of Ullavee.

651
58:42.880 --> 58:47.480
Merng Mang is just a small border city.

652
58:47.480 --> 58:51.600
It could never invade and conquer Ullavee.

653
58:52.960 --> 58:57.280
I see. Is there anyone else like that?

654
59:01.360 --> 59:06.840
If you mean someone with close ties to Merng Mang,

655
59:08.520 --> 59:10.880
my brother is another.

656
59:13.600 --> 59:18.520
Mueang Fah was born in Ullavee,

657
59:21.520 --> 59:24.400
but was sent to Merng Mang as a child.

658
59:26.800 --> 59:32.760
Prince Mueang Fah was exiled to the border?

659
59:44.880 --> 59:48.800
Mueang Fah was born in Ullavee,

660
59:48.800 --> 59:51.640
but was sent to Merng Mang as a child.

661
59:51.640 --> 59:54.640
Phaya Devaraja...

662
59:54.640 --> 59:57.560
I strip you of your title as third in line to the throne.

663
59:57.560 --> 59:59.840
was the most ruthless of all,

664
59:59.840 --> 01:00:05.800
because he seized the throne by murdering his own siblings.

665
01:00:43.600 --> 01:00:45.720
[Next Week] All ladies-in-waiting must perform their duties

666
01:00:45.720 --> 01:00:48.200
from dawn until dusk.

667
01:00:48.200 --> 01:00:49.920
Besides attending to the King,

668
01:00:49.920 --> 01:00:52.720
you must familiarize yourself with his interests,

669
01:00:52.720 --> 01:00:57.400
such as literature, music, governance, and combat.

670
01:00:57.400 --> 01:01:01.120
I won't mention the rice, the soldiers' bodies, or the fake bandits.

671
01:01:01.120 --> 01:01:04.240
But you must tell Indraraja exactly what I instruct you to say.

672
01:01:04.240 --> 01:01:09.800
You still want to know about Princess Maneethip's past, don't you?

673
01:01:12.000 --> 01:01:13.880
I'll determine an auspicious time.

674
01:01:13.880 --> 01:01:17.320
So your return to Wiang Kaew goes smoothly.

675
01:01:17.320 --> 01:01:18.520
Why must it be Mueang Fah?

676
01:01:18.520 --> 01:01:20.600
I never believed in the Hour of the Plunderer.

677
01:01:20.600 --> 01:01:22.320
An auspicious time?

678
01:01:22.320 --> 01:01:24.280
The Hour of the Ruler.
